    <string name="media_access_explanation">Ukuze ubonise igama nesithonjana sohlelo lokusebenza oludlalayo, vumela ukufinyelela kwesaziso esikrinini esilandelayo. Kubuzwa kuphela izikhathi zemidiya zendawo ezisebenzayo; okuqukethwe kwesaziso akufundwa noma kulondolozwe. Izilawuli zokudlala azisetshenziswa. Izinhlelo zokusebenza ezingashicileli isikhathi semidiya azikwazi ukuhlonzwa, futhi lokhu kuboniswa akufakazeli ukuthi umsindo wazo uthunjiwe.</string>
