    <string name="permission_guide_body">Amadivayisi aseduze / inethiwekhi yendawo: iyadingeka ukuze uthole futhi usakaze kuzipikha eziku-Wi-Fi. Ukuqoshwa komsindo: kuyadingeka yi-Android ukuze uthwebule ukudlalwa kwemidiya; asiwuqophi umbhobho wakho. Izaziso: ozikhethela zona, zesimo sokudlulisela kanye nenkinobho yokumisa, hhayi imiyalezo ephushwayo. Ukuboniswa kohlelo lokusebenza oludlalayo kungokuzikhethela futhi kusebenzisa ukufinyelela kwesaziso. Yivule ngokuhlukile kuzilungiselelo kuphela uma ufuna amagama ezinhlelo zokusebenza, izithonjana nokukhethwa okuthile kohlelo lokusebenza. Ukudluliselwa kwayo yonke imidiya kusebenza ngaphandle kwalokho. Thepha Setha ukuze ucele izimvume ezingekho. I-Android ingase ibonise amabhokisi ezingxoxo ahlukene. Ungase wenqabe futhi uzivule kamuva usebenzisa izinkinobho ezikhona noma izilungiselelo zohlelo lokusebenza lwe-Android. Imvume yokuthwebula icelwa kuphela lapho uqalisa ukudlulisela futhi kufanele ivunywe kuso sonke iseshini esisha.</string>
